# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LS100 assignment template — files Git should NOT save
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Video files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Videos are too large for GitHub (100 MB limit per file) and make the
# repository slow for everyone. Keep raw videos in Google Drive and write
# where they live in data/raw/README.md. Commit the small CSV outputs instead.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.avi
*.AVI
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mkv
*.wmv
*.m4v
*.webm

# ── Large model files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model weights (e.g. YOLO .pt files) are downloaded or trained in Colab.
# Note in data/raw/README.md where your trained model is stored.
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.h5
*.ckpt
runs/

# ── Large audio files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Short .wav clips are fine; remove these lines if your assignment needs them.
*.flac
*.aiff

# ── Python and Jupyter clutter ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Operating-system clutter ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
